{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01430","headline":"相和歌辞 襄阳曲 · 李端","name":"相和歌辞 襄阳曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"襄阳堤路长，草碧杨柳黄。\n谁家女儿临夜妆，红罗帐里有灯光。\n雀钗翠羽动明璫，欲出不出脂粉香。\n同居女伴正衣裳，中庭寒月白如霜。\n贾生十八称才子，空得门前一断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}